        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Complete4.1 author proof read, including fundamental-solution factorization, positivity-based backward time contraction, uniform short-time perturbation of property-J matrices, finite-spatial graph transformation and its limit, local denominator control, time interval iteration and analytic continuation. The normalized triangular Weyl construction and prior zero-curvature factorization are established cited background in2.2. No existence theorem, dNLS quasi-analytic claim, ordered-Dhat initial-value uniqueness4.2, or claim recovering an arbitrary diagonal of rho is selected."
