      "extra_source_paths": [
        "raw/sigma-2016-001-036/paper-001-source/sigma16-001.tex",
        "raw/sigma-2016-001-036/paper-001-source.zip"
      ],
      "statement_scope": "D=diag(d1>...>dm>0), Dhat any positive diagonal matrix; rho=rho* uniformly bounded and C1 on x>=0,0<=t<a, satisfying N-wave1.8. R_t=(iz Dhat-[Dhat,rho(0,t)])R,R(0,z)=I. The normalized upper-triangular Weyl matrix for w_x=(izD-[D,rho])w evolves through the exact4.2 fractional graphs and4.3 column recovery, for Im z<-M with M above the explicit uniform commutator/gap threshold. Dhat need not be ordered. No existence or complete-rho uniqueness assertion.",
